      "value": "This doesn't appear to be a bug report, and is instead what we'd consider a support request.\nIt seems like you have probably configured your Safety settings incorrectly! Please open the Safety section of your Menu and set your shield level back to Normal. If you're on Custom, try checking the settings.\nIf you continue to have issues, please contact our [Support team](http://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/new) and report your issue there. Please include as much information as possible, such as game logs, screenshots, and etc. Our support team will get back to you as soon as possible.",
